    "AppleOLYHAL owns platform/PCIe glue in the kernel; it is not an interchangeable WCN3990 bus driver.",
    "AppleBCMWLANBusInterfacePCIe and AppleBCMWLANCore run as DriverKit IOUserService objects in this firmware.",
    "Infrastructure interface uses IOUserNetworkWLAN in the kernel and a private IO80211DriverKit subclass in user space.",
    "Public NetworkingDriverKit Ethernet APIs do not define the private iOS WLAN control/queue ABI."
